<td id="S4.T2.10.1.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.55pt 4.3pt;"><span id="S4.T2.10.1.6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">12.6</span><span id="S4.T2.10.1.6.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"> (+3.0)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.10.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
